OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear
OL,6,Fperiods across the north at first this
OL,7,Fevening. Otherwise a cloudy evening
OL,8,Fand night with outbreaks of rain
OL,9,Fspreading from the southwest. Light
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FOvernight rain soon clearing.
OL,13,FThen it will be a mostly dry day with
OL,14,Fsome sunny intervals developing by
OL,15,Fafternoon.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,18,Fintervals and scattered showers on
OL,19,FWednesday. Dry for most of Thursday
OL,20,Fbut rain spreading east later. Cloudy
OL,21,Fand mainly dry on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
